    <h1>The Voice: <em>Storyteller</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you can take a tangle of information and make it clear, sharp, and impossible to ignore, Storyteller is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, why it lives on the page rather than on a stage, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot to watch.</p>
